WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.762
The reconciliation is the kit's Build 3.

2
00:00:02.762 --> 00:00:07.837
It reads an HR extract, a C S V where
employee I D and status are required;

3
00:00:07.837 --> 00:00:11.397
Graph users with their
employee I D, enabled flag,

4
00:00:11.397 --> 00:00:16.737
department and manager's employee I
D; SailPoint identities from Search

5
00:00:16.737 --> 00:00:21.900
and uncorrelated accounts; and,
optionally, the Entra directory audit.

6
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.813
In the labs each one is a saved export.

7
00:00:24.813 --> 00:00:29.267
Each finding's I D is a hash of
its class, system, employee I D,

8
00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:34.670
object I D and attribute, so the same
drift gets the same I D on every run,

9
00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:38.462
and the PowerShell client
produces the same I Ds.

10
00:00:38.462 --> 00:00:43.824
It writes JSON and C S V, saying which
classes were and weren't computed.

11
00:00:43.824 --> 00:00:46.387
Why run it at all, when events exist?

12
00:00:46.387 --> 00:00:51.079
Events catch changes as they happen;
the reconciliation catches the state,

13
00:00:51.079 --> 00:00:53.640
including drift whose event was missed.
